"""
Money-Center Bank Earnings Tracker — static site generator.

Run:  python bank_dashboard.py
      python bank_dashboard.py --panel bank_panel.csv --out index.html

Reads the raw long-format panel written by edgar_bank_pipeline.py and emits a
self-contained Chart.js page. No server, no Streamlit — the output is a single
index.html suitable for GitHub Pages.

Pipeline of record:
    python edgar_bank_pipeline.py     ->  bank_panel.csv
    python bank_dashboard.py          ->  index.html

Design notes / fixes baked in:
  - SNAPSHOT IS QUARTERLY. The previous page built its cross-bank table at
    annual frequency, so the newest column was FY2025 and no preliminary point
    could ever appear -- on a Q2 tracker that silently hid the whole quarter.
  - ALLOWANCE FOR CREDIT LOSSES IS CHARTED. It was missing from the live page
    despite being present in the panel for all seven banks.
  - STARS KEY STRICTLY ON PRELIM_FORM_LABEL. '10-Q (manual)' rows are filed
    figures that SEC simply has not ingested yet; they must render unstarred.
  - SITE_URL drives og:url / og:image so link unfurls resolve to the repo that
    actually hosts the page.
"""

